Em quinta-feira, 27 de julho de 2017 01:05:16 UTC+3, Vincent Broman 
escreveu:
>
> Is there consensus about which PEG grammar best represents current 
> standard lojban (CLL1+BPFK)?
> Where do I find it?
>
>
Must be https://github.com/lojban/ilmentufa/blob/master/camxes.peg

Although note that it some ways it's significant deviation from CLL not 
approved by BPFK. E.g. handling indicators, allowing infinite loops, 
inability to handle left recursion. On the other hand this grammar includes 
handling morphology and magical words probably approved by BPFK,
 

